    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "C24D2D51CE031418",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n我有句话想跟你说！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "C24D2E51CE0315CB",
      "text": "你和乌栗的对战！\\n像大火一样燃爆了！！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C24D2F51CE03177E",
      "text": "乌栗从北上回来以后\\n一场都没输过，\\r\\n你竟然把他打了个落花流水！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C24D3051CE031931",
      "text": "难怪蓝莓联盟\\n瞬间就被点燃了！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C24D3151CE031AE4",
      "text": "然后！\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你当上冠军的话，\\r\\n乌栗就会降为四天王……[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C24D3251CE031C97",
      "text": "这样一来，很遗憾……四天王里\\n最弱的我就要被挤出去了！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "3E4ABBAA2F752252",
      "text": "这样啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "3E4ABAAA2F75209F",
      "text": "抱歉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C24D3351CE031E4A",
      "text": "哎呀～真的好难受啊～！\\n但规矩就是规矩，没办法！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C24D3451CE031FFD",
      "text": "而且，联盟社的气氛\\n也变回了过去的样子，\\r\\n对我而言，这样更开心！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C24D2551CE030680",
      "text": "这都是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的功劳！\\n我一直想开明火直说！\\r\\n谢谢你！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "EE5437582F6D29C7",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n话说，你喜欢烹饪吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "9364298E4642F873",
      "text": "喜欢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "93642A8E4642FA26",
      "text": "一般般",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "EE5436582F6D2814",
      "text": "你喜欢啊！太好了！\\c\\n制作超辣的三明治的时候，\\n你的确也完成得很轻松啊！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "6640CDD8967BC082",
      "text": "一般般！？\\c\\n一般般还能顺利完成\\n制作超辣的三明治，好厉害！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "EE5439582F6D2D2D",
      "text": "我当然喜欢烹饪！\\n看我的煎锅就知道了吧！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "EE5438582F6D2B7A",
      "text": "我家是开食堂的！\\n将来我想继承家业！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "EE5433582F6D22FB",
      "text": "进入这所学园，也只是因为\\n被校长挖来了而已！！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "EE5432582F6D2148",
      "text": "所以，这次……\\n乌栗和杜若前辈……[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "EE5435582F6D2661",
      "text": "看到他们因为对战变得那么火热，\\n烧得火星四溅，我很震惊。[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "EE5434582F6D24AE",
      "text": "宝可梦对战真是厉害，\\n竟然能让人变得如此火热。[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "EE542F582F6D1C2F",
      "text": "我觉得自己也可以试着\\n把火力再～加大一点！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "4600615FCBEC4FF6",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你听我说！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "4600625FCBEC51A9",
      "text": "据说我好像还能\\n继续当四天王！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "23BA9267B1786E38",
      "text": "好啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "23BA9567B1787351",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "46005F5FCBEC4C90",
      "text": "嗯，好……吗！？\\n我也不太清楚！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "DEEF01C78286BF36",
      "text": "哎呀，连我自己\\n也不太清楚！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "4600605FCBEC4E43",
      "text": "因为乌栗休学了一阵子，\\n还有各种事情……[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "4600655FCBEC56C2",
      "text": "所以蓝莓联盟暂停排名变动？\\n……据说是这样的！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "4600665FCBEC5875",
      "text": "紫竽前辈跟我解释过，\\n但是太复杂，我忘了！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "4600635FCBEC535C",
      "text": "能把各个广场当作据点\\n是四天王的特权，非常方便，\\r\\n所以对我而言，真是走运啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
