    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "73934571A505BCE3",
      "text": "带着煎锅\\n就可以随时炒菜了！\\c\\n就算有敌人来袭，\\n也能立刻保护自己！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
