    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "73934471A505BB30",
      "text": "紫竽前辈\\n有没有喜欢的人呢？\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你听说什么了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
